     "t": "key",
     "title": "名词变复数：规则和例外",
     "what": [
      "一般加 <b>-s</b>：book → books，friend → friends",
      "以 <b>s, x, sh, ch</b> 结尾加 <b>-es</b>：bus → buses，box → boxes，watch → watches",
      "<b>辅音 + y</b> 变 <b>ies</b>：city → cities，family → families（元音 + y 直接加 s：day → days, boy → boys）",
      "<b>f / fe</b> 多变 <b>ves</b>：knife → knives，life → lives，leaf → leaves",
      "<b>不规则</b>：man → men，woman → women，child → children，person → people，foot → feet，tooth → teeth，mouse → mice"
     ],
     "why": [
      "大部分规则都是为了“好读”：box 直接加 s 读不出来，就加 -es；不规则复数是古英语留下的，数量不多，背下来就行。"
     ],
     "zh": [
      "中文名词不变：“一本书、两本书”，靠数量词和量词表示。英语名词本身要变：a book、two book<b>s</b>。",
      "中文的量词（本、个、只）英语一般不需要：两本书 → two books（不说 two pieces of book）。"
     ],
     "ex": [
      [
       "one book → two books",
       ""
      ],
      [
       "one child → three children",
       "不规则"
